<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Your next journey starts here | TrackEase</title><jsp:include page="WEB-INF/ui/head.jsp" /></head><body>
<jsp:include page="navbar.jsp" /><main id="main-content"><section class="landing-hero"><div class="shell hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow">A little less planning. A lot more travelling.</span><h1>Your next<br>journey,<br><em>made easy.</em></h1><p>From the first search to your reserved seat. Find your train, book with confidence, and keep every journey in one place.</p><div class="hero-buttons"><a class="button" href="${esc:html(pageContext.request.contextPath)}/user/bookTicket.jsp">Find your train <i class="fas fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a><a class="button secondary" href="#how-it-works">Explore TrackEase</a></div><p class="hero-note">Automatic seat allocation. A simpler start.</p></div><div class="hero-art"><img src="${esc:html(pageContext.request.contextPath)}/assets/images/rail-landscape.svg" alt="Illustration of a train winding through green mountains at sunset"><span class="art-label">Take the scenic route</span><div class="art-ticket"><small>Less hassle. More horizon.</small><div class="art-route"><span>Find a train</span><span aria-hidden="true">····→</span><span>Make a memory</span></div></div></div></div></section><div class="shell promise-strip"><div class="promise"><i class="fas fa-route" aria-hidden="true"></i><div><strong>Your route, your way</strong><small>Search by stations and travel date</small></div></div><div class="promise"><i class="fas fa-chair" aria-hidden="true"></i><div><strong>A seat, sorted</strong><small>Coach and seat assigned automatically</small></div></div><div class="promise"><i class="fas fa-ticket" aria-hidden="true"></i><div><strong>Every ticket together</strong><small>View, print, and manage your bookings</small></div></div></div><section class="shell section-space" id="how-it-works"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">The journey before the journey</span><h2>Three steps. You're on your way.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="${esc:html(pageContext.request.contextPath)}/register.jsp">Get started <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="feature-grid"><article class="feature-block"><span class="feature-number">01</span><h3>Find your connection.</h3><p>Choose your departure, destination, and date. Compare scheduled journeys, fares, and available seats.</p></article><article class="feature-block"><span class="feature-number">02</span><h3>Leave the seat to us.</h3><p>Confirm your booking for an automatically allocated seat. If a train is full, you can choose to join its waiting list.</p></article><article class="feature-block"><span class="feature-number">03</span><h3>Keep the details close.</h3><p>Access your tickets anytime. Check your booking status, print your journey details, or cancel before departure.</p></article></div></section></main>
<jsp:include page="WEB-INF/ui/footer.jsp" /></body></html>